{
  "name": "Day 24 — AI Proposal Generator for Freelancers",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 24: AI Proposal Generator for Freelancers\n\n\n**Setup:**\n- Connect: OpenAI API key\n- Connect: Gmail (Google OAuth)\n- Connect: Google Sheets (Google OAuth)\n- \"Deals\" tab headers: client, email, budget, stage, date\n\nCourse: Day 24 lesson page",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "78e41ce8-8856-40a7-aac2-93437b80ffa8",
      "name": "Setup Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "New proposal",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "client_name",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "client_email",
              "fieldType": "email",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "business",
              "placeholder": "e.g. dental clinic, 2 branches",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "problem",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "hours_wasted_per_week",
              "fieldType": "number"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "budget",
              "fieldType": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2113e92d-17dd-4cf0-ae85-dadb6dca1583",
      "name": "Discovery Form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "0316d47c-6b62-44d8-a648-b84aef5bea49"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a senior automation consultant writing a short, clear proposal email.\nClient: {{ $json.client_name }} ({{ $json.business }})\nProblem: {{ $json.problem }}\nHours wasted per week: {{ $json.hours_wasted_per_week }}\nBudget: ₹{{ $json.budget }}\n\nWrite: 1) one-line understanding of the problem, 2) proposed n8n solution in 3-5 bullets (trigger → steps → result), 3) deliverables, 4) timeline (phases), 5) price: one-time setup + optional monthly maintenance, within budget, 6) ROI: hours saved × ₹500/hour per month, 7) next step: 50% advance to start. Simple English, max 250 words, no hype."
      },
      "id": "b73078e1-dfd8-4d22-a4ad-66d155be3501",
      "name": "Write Proposal",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        260,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "8e6719ef-7ba3-4745-a318-7e7d58bdcee0",
      "name": "Proposal Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        160,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "draft",
        "subject": "=Proposal: automation for {{ $('Discovery Form').item.json.business }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "options": {
          "sendTo": "={{ $('Discovery Form').item.json.client_email }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "b27ef4c6-098f-4018-adc6-7f4a4a32ebad",
      "name": "Gmail Draft",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        520,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "PASTE_YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Deals",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "client": "={{ $('Discovery Form').item.json.client_name }}",
            "email": "={{ $('Discovery Form').item.json.client_email }}",
            "budget": "={{ $('Discovery Form').item.json.budget }}",
            "stage": "proposal sent",
            "date": "={{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd') }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "58a969bb-19c6-4a14-ac67-0c995a0f43f7",
      "name": "Deals Sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        780,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
